---
import Term from './Term.astro'
interface Props { lang: 'zh' | 'en'; headingLevel?: 2 | 3 }
const { lang, headingLevel = 2 } = Astro.props
const H = `h${headingLevel}`
---
<section class="safety" aria-labelledby={`safety-${lang}`}>
  <H id={`safety-${lang}`}>{lang === 'zh' ? '先读这一段：安全须知' : 'Read this first: safety notice'}</H>
  {lang === 'zh' ? (
    <ul>
      <li>本书所有链上操作<strong>只在 Ethereum <Term id="sepolia">Sepolia</Term> 测试网</strong>上进行。测试网就是专门给人练习用的区块链，里面的币可以免费领取、没有任何价值，像驾校练车场里的车；网络编号 <Term id="chainid">chainId</Term> 是 11155111。本书从未使用<Term id="mainnet">主网</Term>（币有真实价值的<span class="nw">正式网络）。</span></li>
      <li>第一阶段<strong>预算严格为 0 美元</strong>：没有买币，没有花<span class="nw">一分真钱。</span></li>
      <li><Term id="sepeth">测试网 ETH（SepETH）</Term>和书中的<Term id="test-token">测试代币</Term><strong>没有市场价值</strong>，<span class="nw">不是收益。</span></li>
      <li>本书<strong>不构成投资建议</strong>，也不是第三方<span class="nw">安全<Term id="audit">审计</Term>证书。</span></li>
      <li><strong>永远不要</strong>把真实<Term id="wallet">钱包</Term>的<Term id="seed-phrase">助记词</Term>或<Term id="private-key">私钥</Term>（相当于钱包的总钥匙）导入任何实验环境、网页、聊天或<span class="nw">代码仓库。</span></li>
      <li>这是个人学习资料，<strong>不是</strong> Ethereum、Etherscan 或任何公司的<span class="nw">官方产品。</span></li>
    </ul>
  ) : (
    <ul>
      <li>Every on-chain action in this book happened <strong>only on the Ethereum <Term id="sepolia">Sepolia</Term> testnet</strong>. A testnet is a blockchain made for practice: its coins are free and worth nothing, like the cars in a driving-school yard. Its network number, the <Term id="chainid">chainId</Term>, is 11155111. <Term id="mainnet">Mainnet</Term> (the real network, where coins have real value) <span class="nw">was never used.</span></li>
      <li>The phase-1 <strong>budget was strictly $0</strong>: no crypto was bought and no real money <span class="nw">was spent.</span></li>
      <li><Term id="sepeth">Test ETH (SepETH)</Term> and the <Term id="test-token">test tokens</Term> in this book have <strong>no market value</strong>. They are <span class="nw">not earnings.</span></li>
      <li>This book is <strong>not financial advice</strong> and not a third-party <span class="nw">security <Term id="audit">audit</Term>.</span></li>
      <li><strong>Never</strong> import a real <Term id="wallet">wallet</Term>'s <Term id="seed-phrase">seed phrase</Term> or <Term id="private-key">private key</Term> (the master key to a wallet) into any lab, website, chat or <span class="nw">code repository.</span></li>
      <li>These are personal study notes, <strong>not</strong> an official product of Ethereum, Etherscan or <span class="nw">any company.</span></li>
    </ul>
  )}
</section>
